  "factor_name": "Breadth-Conditioned Trend Residualized to Common-Return Beta",
  "version": "2035-10-15",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "residualize(shift( breadth_confidence * (0.4*momentum20/vol40/sqrt20 + 0.6*momentum60/vol40/sqrt60), 1), lagged_60d_beta_to_equal_weight_return)",
    "description": "Compute volatility-scaled 20-day and 60-day momentum, multiply by lagged signed breadth confidence, lag the signal one session, then cross-sectionally remove its linear component explained by each asset's lagged 60-day beta to the equal-weight cross-asset return. Forward target is the 20-trading-day return from t+1 through t+20."
  },
